WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.940
Somebody has to evaluate the evaluations.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.748
At Slop University, that's Dr Dagny Okafor.

00:00:07.248 --> 00:00:09.518
I convene Evaluation of Evaluation.

00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:12.578
We study the checks an institution runs on itself,

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:14.138
and ask what they change.

00:00:14.638 --> 00:00:18.446
A tick box that says a worker knows food safety.

00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:20.986
Minutes that every committee member signed.

00:00:21.286 --> 00:00:23.296
A manager's click on an expense claim.

00:00:24.296 --> 00:00:28.616
Her paper on that tick box is one of the three most cited at Slop University.

00:00:29.116 --> 00:00:31.826
She has published two hundred and six research outputs.

00:00:32.626 --> 00:00:34.376
One thousand and fifty-six citations,

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.536
and an h-index of twenty-six.

00:00:37.936 --> 00:00:40.206
She's also won the Deposit of the Quarter Prize.

00:00:41.406 --> 00:00:45.260
A review that changes nothing still teaches us something.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.590
Usually about the review.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.369
Her research is on our website,

00:00:49.519 --> 00:00:50.859
our news is on Bluesky,

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.179
and our inbox is open.
